    <string name="google_drive_title">Connect Google Drive</string>
    <string name="google_drive_setup_steps">1. Create a Desktop/Mobile OAuth client in Google Cloud.\n2. Paste the client id below.\n3. Choose a credential passphrase for the encrypted local session.\n4. Keep local storage as the default mode until the mobile browser callback is completed.\n5. The desktop app already uses the same Google Drive scopes for browser sign-in.</string>
